| `seriesOrder` | `string[]`                                        | -       | Control segment stacking order for canonical format                           |
| `width`       | `number \| string`                                | `328`   | Total width of the chart                                                      |
| `height`      | `number \| string`                                | `440`   | **Total height of the chart.** VerticalStackedBarGroup fills remaining space. |
| `chartHeader` | `boolean`                                         | `true`  | Show/hide the chart header                                                    |
| `chartFooter` | `boolean`                                         | `true`  | Show/hide the chart footer                                                    |
| `chartLegend` | `boolean`                                         | `true`  | Show/hide the chart legend                                                    |
| `dataDisplay` | `boolean`                                         | `false` | Show DataDisplay component above the bar group                                |
| `fullWidth`   | `boolean`                                         | `false` | Stretch chart to fill parent container width (overrides `width`)              |
| `interactive` | `boolean`                                         | `true`  | Enable hover/click interactivity on bars                                      |
| `animated`    | `boolean`                                         | `false` | Enable entry and data-change animations with motion tokens                    |

