#### `yAxisConfig`

| Prop              | Type                        | Default         | Description                                                                                           |
| ----------------- | --------------------------- | --------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| `tickCount`       | `number`                    | `6`             | Target number of Y-axis ticks                                                                         |
| `formatValue`     | `(value: number) => string` | `undefined`     | Custom formatter for Y-axis labels                                                                    |
| `valueFormat`     | `ValueFormatConfig`         | `undefined`     | Value format configuration for Y-axis labels (overrides `formatValue` and parent-level `valueFormat`) |
| `yAxisLabel`      | `boolean`                   | `false`         | Show rotated label to the left of tick marks                                                          |
| `yAxisLabelValue` | `string`                    | `"yAxis label"` | Text content for the Y-axis label                                                                     |
| `axisTickSkipper` | `boolean`                   | `false`         | Show the axis break indicator (auto-enabled when `skippedTicks` is provided)                          |
